      "writtenOn": "2024-04-09T14:26:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e About removing this explicit block for permission check \u0026 letting nativeSpawn or nativeConnect itself throws SecurityException error instead, what about deferring this task into following change?\n\nI have a slight preference for fixing it now, but if it\u0027s blocking other things then a followup CL would be fine.\n\n\u003e Because MicrodroidTestAppNoPerm doesn\u0027t use permission MANAGE_VIRTUAL_MACHINE unlike MicrodroidTestApp.\n\nAh, of course. This is all so complicated :-(",
      "parentUuid": "5ab2e129_2932d7e7",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 66,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 70,
        "endChar": 9
      },
      "revId": "01b2fee99eea150df5749ab1ae1f9d9b23411ecf",
