      "writtenOn": "2024-04-11T09:11:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Gah! Synchronisation is hard.\nMaybe rather than just closing the pipe to signal ready, we should send a single byte down it? That way we can distinguish close due to failure from close due to success.",
